     "text": "and its certificate."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S14",
   "chapter": 2,
   "from": 1922,
   "to": 2098,
   "text": "Then something strange happens: both sides compute the same secret — without either one sending it.",
   "para": true,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 1922,
     "to": 1978,
     "text": "Then something strange happens:"
    },
    {
     "from": 1979,
     "to": 2049,
     "text": "both sides compute the same secret —"
    },
    {
     "from": 2050,
     "to": 2098,
     "text": "without either one sending it."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S15",
   "chapter": 2,
   "from": 2154,
   "to": 2341,
   "text": "From here on, everything is symmetric encryption, AES-GCM. Fast, stream-like, sealed.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 2154,
     "to": 2203,
     "text": "From here on, everything is"
    },
    {
     "from": 2204,
