     "text": "The little lock is just... normal."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S34",
   "chapter": 4,
   "from": 5215,
   "to": 5491,
   "text": "And the lock keeps being re-forged: encrypted ClientHello is now standard, and post-quantum key exchange already protects most browser traffic.",
   "para": true,
   "subs": [
    {
     "from": 5215,
     "to": 5283,
     "text": "And the lock keeps being re-forged:"
